<title>MEXICO: Mexico approves 18 pension fund management firms.</title>
<headline>Mexico approves 18 pension fund management firms.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico on Monday announced it had given the green light for the setting up of 18 private pension fund management firms, or Afores, out of 24 firms that had sought approval.</p>
<p>The companies are expected to begin operating in mid-1997, but must pass a series of other tests before they receive final authorization, officials from the National Commission for the Retirement Savings System told a news conference.</p>
</text>
